    "Every Imp, service, key, tool, trigger, chat and setting is deleted. This can't be undone." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Se eliminan todos los Imps, servicios, claves, herramientas, disparadores, chats y ajustes. No se puede deshacer."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "所有 Imp、服务、密钥、工具、触发器、对话和设置都将被删除。此操作无法撤销。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every chat is saved. Carry on in an older one, save it or bring one in." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Cada chat se guarda. Sigue uno anterior, guárdalo o trae uno."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "每个聊天都会保存。可继续旧聊天、保存或导入。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every chat with %@, newest first. Continue one to pick up where you left off." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Todos los chats con %@, el más reciente primero. Sigue uno para retomarlo donde lo dejaste."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "与 %@ 的所有聊天，最新的在前。继续某个聊天即可从上次停下处接着聊。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Every condition must be true when it goes off, like the battery being low or the time being late." : {
