    "What %@ and %@ said to each other, both ways. This is only to read: it comes from both Imps' chats. Show it as bubbles or as JSON, and copy the JSON." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "en" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "new",
            "value" : "What %1$@ and %2$@ said to each other, both ways. This is only to read: it comes from both Imps' chats. Show it as bubbles or as JSON, and copy the JSON."
          }
        },
        "es" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Lo que %1$@ y %2$@ se dijeron entre sí, en ambos sentidos. Es solo para leer: viene de los chats de ambos Imps. Muéstralo como burbujas o como JSON, y copia el JSON."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "%1$@ 和 %2$@ 彼此说过的话，双向都有。仅供阅读：内容来自两个 Imp 的对话。可以显示为气泡或 JSON，也可以拷贝 JSON。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
